se},{\"id\":\"s1\",\"start\":124,\"length\":124,\"frameCount\":124,\"durationSec\":5,\"prompt\":\"integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, the same street-corner bun stall continues under the canvas awning, morning mist thinning as the sky brightens. A young woman in a beige trench coat with a black shoulder bag hurries into frame and stops at the stall counter, slightly out of breath. The stocky vendor in the white apron and grey beanie (S1) looks up and says warmly: <d>[Chinese] 姑娘，来几个?</d> [Shot 2] At 00:02.500, the camera cuts to a medium close-up as she hands over a folded bill and answers with a smile: <d>[Chinese] 两个，谢谢叔!</d> The vendor drops two buns into a paper bag and passes it across the counter.\\n\\noverall_soundscape: Hurried footsteps approach over the pavement, followed by the rustle of a paper bag, the clink of coins in a tin box, and soft morning traffic passing behind them.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music: The gentle guzheng-and-flute motif continues at a slow tempo, rising slightly in brightness as the exchange completes.\",\"taskType\":\"\",\"refs\":[],\"referenceVideo\":{},\"genImage\":{\"imageFile\":\"\"},\"negativePrompt\":\"\",\"continuityFromPrev\":true},{\"id\":\"s2\",\"start\":248,\"length\":124,\"frameCount\":124,\"durationSec\":5,\"prompt\":\"integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, at the same bun stall counter, the young woman in the beige trench coat holds the warm paper bag with both hands. She takes a bite of a bun, cheeks rounding, and her eyes narrow with satisfaction as she chews. [Shot 2] At 00:02.000, the camera cuts to a low-angle wide shot as she turns and walks down the street into softening golden dawn light, her breath visible in the cool air. Behind her, the vendor lifts the next steamer lid and another burst of white steam rises into the brightening sky.\\n\\noverall_soundscape: A soft crunch as she bites the bun, followed by light cheerful footsteps moving away. Behind her